# Google Maps Embed API key — OPTIONAL upgrade.
#
# The event map's "Get directions" and "Street View" buttons open in-app
# dialogs whether or not this is set: without it they use Google's keyless
# embed URLs, and with it they use the official Maps Embed API (more reliable,
# especially for Street View). Nothing breaks when it is unset.
#
# This value ships in the browser bundle, so treat it as public, not a secret.
# In Google Cloud, restrict it:
#   - Application restriction: HTTP referrers — add http://localhost:5173/*
#     and your production domain(s).
#   - API restriction: Maps Embed API only.
# The Embed API is free and unlimited, but its Google Cloud project must have
# billing enabled.
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_EMBED_KEY=
